  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the community-driven development process in the Departments of Madriz and Managua with an emphasis on rural development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFPF will reach more than 1,200 students with its application of the Sistema de Aprendizaje Tutorial, a secondary- school program, in the communities of San Jos de Cusmapa and San Isidro de Bolas. It will develop teaching materials, train tutors in the SAT methodology and launch the academic curriculum. Through the AFPF program, students will also be able to take advantage of community development and revenue-generating activities and opportunities to volunteer.</narrative>
  </description>
